# prevent-damage-on-turn at turn 1: "At the beginning of your upkeep, if it's your first turn, prevent all damage that would
# be dealt to you this turn." Bot1's own Lightning Bolt at itself on turn 1 is prevented (CR 615.1a); the effect lasts the
# turn only (CR 615.3), so Bot2's Bolt on turn 2 and Bot1's on turn 3 are dealt.

